==id $Id: owfpresent_lib.sfd 3.0 (25.10.2026) $
* "owfpresent.library" 3.0: OpenPresentation's part of libowf:
* presentations. The deck model, its formats (ODP, flat ODP) and the page
* PDF writer, with the document model its text uses.
* Copyright (c) 2026 AmigaChrome Team. MIT licence (see LICENSE).
* The calls are libowf's, with its names and types; new calls go at the end.
* The first 17, libowf's shared calls (memory, reports, kinds, zip), are the
* same calls at the same offsets in all four of GFOffice's libraries
* (docs/suite/owf-libraries.md). A double goes in two data registers, its
* high word first, as mathieeedoubbas.library takes them.
==base _OWFPresentBase
==basetype struct Library *
==libname owfpresent.library
==bias 30
==public
==include <exec/types.h>
==include <owf.h>
==include <owf_deck.h>
==include <owf_pdf.h>
==include <owf_zip.h>
==version 3
